### API Gateway Endpoints

# Gateway Status
GET http://localhost:5000/api/gateway/status
Accept: application/json

###

# Gateway Routes Information
GET http://localhost:5000/api/gateway/routes
Accept: application/json

###

# Gateway Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/health
Accept: application/json

###

# Service Discovery
GET http://localhost:5000/api/discovery
Accept: application/json

###

# Products through Gateway (requires authentication)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

# Categories through Gateway (requires authentication)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/categories
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

# Auth through Gateway (login/register)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "user@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

###

# Register through Gateway
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "newuser@example.com",
    "password": "Password123!",
    "firstName": "New",
    "lastName": "User"
}

###

# Internal Products (no authentication required)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/internal/products
Accept: application/json

###

# Internal Users (no authentication required)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/internal/users
Accept: application/json

###

# Users through Gateway (requires authentication)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}